            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1301/02 Decorative Door Viewer Bezel</b>\r\n<p>\r\nAdd beauty to that forgotten piece of hardware on your door, the door viewer (peephole)!  They install in as little as 5 minutes, and the only tool needed to add one to an existing door viewer is a quarter shaped object! For use with 1/2\" diameter door viewer. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCan be used on both the exterior and interior of your door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 1301/02 Door Viewer Bezel\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outer Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Hole Diameter: 5/8\" (For use with 1/2\" diameter door viewer)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p> \r\n<b>Door viewer is not included.</b>  \r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
